#. habla: Shawna
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "#159"
msgid "What's that? What does he look like? He's tall, with long hair, and apparently pretty good looking. But I heard he's kind of strange, and over thirty and single."
msgstr "¿Qué dices? ¿Cómo es? Es alto, de pelo largo y, al parecer, bastante apuesto. Pero escuché que es un poco raro, y que tiene más de treinta y está soltero."

#. habla: Shawna
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "#160"
msgid "Besides him? Hmm. Kiku, who's also on Second Miltia, is supposed to be an avid collector of old books, but she's really narrow-minded. She might not even speak to you!"
msgstr "¿Aparte de él? Hmm. Kiku, que también está en Segunda Miltia, se supone que es una gran coleccionista de libros viejos, pero es muy cerrada. ¡Quizá ni te dirija la palabra!"

#. habla: Shawna
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "#161"
msgid "There's another book besides \"Rules of High Society\" that's getting a lot of attention lately. It's called the \"Entertainment Guide.\" It's perfect for all of us living on the Foundation."
